<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:40:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着租金创下新高，银行家们纷纷出钱购买香港公寓</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bankers-pay-up-for-hong-kong-apartments-as-rents-hit-new-highs</link><description>香港蓬勃发展的租赁房地产市场正在刺激以前被低估的社区的收益，因为银行家在世界上最昂贵的居住地之一支付公寓费用。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bankers-pay-up-for-hong-kong-apartments-as-rents-hit-new-highs'&gt;随着租金创下新高，银行家们纷纷出钱购买香港公寓&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bankers Pay Up for Hong Kong Apartments as Rents Hit New Highs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bankers-pay-up-for-hong-kong-apartments-as-rents-hit-new-highs</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢拉任命布拉德斯科董事长为财务主管以安抚市场</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-taps-bradesco-chairman-as-finance-chief-to-reassure-markets</link><description>巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦任命布拉德斯科主席路易斯·卡洛斯·特拉布科·卡皮担任财政部长，并求助于巴西最著名的银行家之一，以恢复投资者对国家财政的信心。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-taps-bradesco-chairman-as-finance-chief-to-reassure-markets'&gt;卢拉任命布拉德斯科董事长为财务主管以安抚市场&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Lula Taps Bradesco Chairman as Finance Chief to Reassure Markets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-taps-bradesco-chairman-as-finance-chief-to-reassure-markets</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:18:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳大利亚通过天然气储备法令液化天然气出口商感到不安</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-set-to-pass-gas-reserve-law-in-upset-to-lng-exporters</link><description>澳大利亚通过了一项法律，要求液化天然气出口商将多达五分之一的供应量保留给国内市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-set-to-pass-gas-reserve-law-in-upset-to-lng-exporters'&gt;澳大利亚通过天然气储备法令液化天然气出口商感到不安&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Passes Gas Reserve Law in Upset to LNG Exporters&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-set-to-pass-gas-reserve-law-in-upset-to-lng-exporters</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:31:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stock Futures Signal Gains, Oil Advances: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>